{
  "name": "Accountant Document Intake & Q&A",
  "description": "A workflow reads every invoice, spreadsheet, Word file or scanned PDF dropped in SharePoint and writes figures, reasoning and anomalies to Dataverse. A Q&A agent answers from that data through MCP, excluding duplicates and test rows from totals, and opens the source file only when needed.",
